WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
When the frontier burned, the dead got up.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
The last grove pulled up its roots.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
And something crawled out of the black tide.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
Pick a people. Pick your soldiers. Lock them in.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
No second chances. Fate rolls the dice.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
Every order you gave plays out, exactly as you wrote it.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Three peoples. One horizon. Claim it.
